{"quest_id": 6023, "name": "東方の戦士（記憶）", "description": "宝を守る守護者を打ち倒し、\n古の財宝を手に入れろ！\n＜ヘビーアーマー出撃不可＞\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "modifier_notes": ["ヘビーアーマー出撃不可"], "event": "戦場の記憶", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920085, "map_no": 3753, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 24, "expression": "IsClassType(2,202) == 0;", "expression_human": "its class type is not one of 2 / 202"}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 42000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 42000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_range": 10, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 90, "attack_interval": 241, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.0, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103888, "special_effect_id": 219, "missile_id": 11, "master_id": 56, "global_id": 55, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 3}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 49}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 7000, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 7000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 300.0, "dot_rate": 1.100000023841858, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103968, "special_effect_id": 219, "master_id": 612, "global_id": 611, "spawn_sec": 54}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 9000, "attack": 700, "base_hp": 9000, "base_attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 300.0, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103984, "special_effect_id": 219, "master_id": 613, "global_id": 612, "spawn_sec": 63}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 3500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 300.0, "dot_rate": 1.0, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2103952, "master_id": 588, "global_id": 587, "spawn_sec": 72}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "モニカ", "text": "こんなところで人に会うなんてね。ここは禁断の島と\n呼ばれる魔物の住処になっている島のひとつよ。\nあなたたちも島に隠されたお宝を狙っているのかしら。", "face": "u87"}, {"name": "モニカ", "text": "この島には魔水晶と呼ばれるお宝が眠っているの。\nだけど、そのお宝は魔水晶を守る守護者が\n守っているわ……。", "face": "u87"}, {"name": "モニカ", "text": "……ちょうど現れたみたいね、アレが守護者よ！\n魔水晶の守護者には、魔法の威力が\n半減するから注意してちょうだい。", "face": "u87"}, {"name": "モニカ", "text": "それともう一つ、この島には重戦士は上陸できないから\nそこに気を付けてね。一緒にお宝を手に入れましょ。", "face": "u87"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "レーヴ", "text": "――王子、お疲れ様でした。\nこの旅路でモニカさんが仲間になられたのですね？", "face": "u454"}, {"name": "レーヴ", "text": "……え？　ち、違う！？", "face": "u454"}, {"name": "レーヴ", "text": "……し、失礼しました！　\n魔水晶の力で封印が解けた\n東方の方が仲間になられたのですね。", "face": "u454"}, {"name": "レーヴ", "text": "それにしても魔水晶にそのような力があるとは……。\n勉強不足を痛感致します。", "face": "u454"}, {"name": "レーヴ", "text": "ですが、王子達の旅路はやはり興味深い事ばかりですね！\n私、なんだかワクワクしてきました！", "face": "u454"}, {"name": "レーヴ", "text": "さぁ、次の記憶へ参りましょう、王子！", "face": "u454"}]}], "active": true}